# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Alaminn.info — Environment template
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#
# Copy to `.env` (development) or `.env.production` (production) and
# replace every placeholder with real values. NEVER commit real values.
#
# Generate AUTH_SECRET with:  openssl rand -hex 32
# Generate CRON_SECRET with:  openssl rand -hex 32
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── Core ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development
# ⚠ SQLite path resolution: the Prisma CLI resolves relative paths against
# prisma/, while the standalone Next server resolves them against its own
# CWD — a relative path can silently create an EMPTY database under
# `output: "standalone"`. For SQLite, use an ABSOLUTE path:
#   DATABASE_URL="file:/absolute/path/to/alaminn.info/db/custom.db"
# Production (MariaDB): DATABASE_URL="mysql://user:pass@host:3306/db"
DATABASE_URL="file:./db/custom.db"
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# ─── Auth ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AUTH_SECRET="<REPLACE_WITH_openssl_rand_hex_32>"
NEXTAUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"                  # Prod: https://alaminn.info

# ─── Admin bootstrap (used by prisma/seed.ts only) ─────────────────
ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_EMAIL="admin@alaminn.info"
ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD="<REPLACE_WITH_A_STRONG_PASSWORD_12+_CHARS>"

# ─── Cron / scheduled tasks ─────────────────────────────────────────
CRON_SECRET="<REPLACE_WITH_openssl_rand_hex_32>"

# ─── Email (SMTP OR Resend — pick one) ──────────────────────────────
EMAIL_FROM="noreply@alaminn.info"
EMAIL_REPLY_TO="hello@alaminn.info"
# Option A: SMTP
SMTP_HOST=""
SMTP_PORT="587"
SMTP_USER=""
SMTP_PASS=""
SMTP_SECURE="false"
# Option B: Resend (alternative to SMTP)
RESEND_API_KEY=""

# ─── WhatsApp Cloud API (Meta) ──────────────────────────────────────
WHATSAPP_NUMBER="01716609554"                         # Local format
WHATSAPP_INTERNATIONAL_NUMBER="8801716609554"         # No '+', no spaces
WHATSAPP_DISPLAY_NUMBER="01716 609 554"
WHATSAPP_BUSINESS_NAME="Al Aminn"
WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN="<REPLACE_WITH_random_string>"
WHATSAPP_API_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=""                      # Meta Cloud API Phone Number ID
WHATSAPP_API_TOKEN=""                                # Meta Cloud API access token

# ─── WhatsApp AI Agent ──────────────────────────────────────────────
WHATSAPP_AI_MODE="dev"                                # dev | live
WHATSAPP_AI_PROVIDER="unorouter"                      # unorouter | groq | gemini | zai
WHATSAPP_AI_MODEL="claude-opus-4-6-thinking"

# ─── ALO Education referral signing (HMAC) ─────────────────────────
HIGHER_STUDY_REFERRAL_SECRET="<REPLACE_WITH_openssl_rand_hex_32>"
ENGLISH_LEARNING_REFERRAL_SECRET="<REPLACE_WITH_openssl_rand_hex_32>"

# ─── Logging ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
LOG_LEVEL="info"                                     # error | warn | info | debug

# ─── Backup retention ──────────────────────────────────────────────
BACKUP_RETENTION_COUNT="14"

# ─── Mini-service: audit-worker (optional, separate DB URL) ────────
AUDIT_WORKER_DATABASE_URL=""

# ─── Social Command Center (Meta) ───────────────────────────────────
META_APP_SECRET=""                                    # Webhook HMAC verification (fail-closed in prod)
META_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN=""                          # Falls back to WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN
# Per-account Page/IG tokens are entered in /admin/social/accounts and stored AES-256-GCM encrypted in DB — not in env.

# ─── Multi-Provider AI Router (UnoRouter Primary + 100% Free AI Fallback Stack) ─
# Configure here OR live inside `/admin/ai-agents` -> AI Providers tab (stored AES-256-GCM encrypted in DB).
FREE_AI_PREFERRED_PROVIDER="unorouter"                # unorouter | auto | groq | gemini | cerebras | openrouter | github | cloudflare | sambanova | zhipu | mistral | huggingface | pollinations | ollama | local-grounded
AI_PREFERRED_PROVIDER="unorouter"                     # Alias for FREE_AI_PREFERRED_PROVIDER
UNOROUTER_API_KEY=""                                  # https://unorouter.com (Primary preferred OpenAI-compatible gateway — claude-opus-4-6-thinking)
UNOROUTER_BASE_URL="https://api.unorouter.com/v1"     # Base URL for https://api.unorouter.com/v1/chat/completions
GROQ_API_KEY=""                                       # https://console.groq.com (14,400 RPD free, no credit card)
GEMINI_API_KEY=""                                     # https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (Gemini 2.5 Flash + text-embedding-004 free)
GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY=""                                  # Optional alias for GEMINI_API_KEY
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=""                                   # https://cloud.cerebras.ai (1M tokens/day free, no credit card)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=""                                 # https://openrouter.ai/keys (:free models aggregator)
GITHUB_MODELS_TOKEN=""                                # https://github.com/settings/tokens (GPT-4.1-mini / DeepSeek-R1 free)
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=""                               # https://dash.cloudflare.com (10,000 neurons/day free)
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=""                              # Cloudflare 32-char Account ID
SAMBANOVA_API_KEY=""                                  # https://cloud.sambanova.ai
CHUTES_API_KEY=""                                     # https://chutes.ai
ZHIPU_API_KEY=""                                      # https://open.bigmodel.cn (GLM-4.5-Flash unlimited free)
MODELSCOPE_API_KEY=""                                 # https://modelscope.cn (2,000 req/day free)
SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=""                                # https://cloud.siliconflow.cn
MISTRAL_API_KEY=""                                    # https://console.mistral.ai
NVIDIA_API_KEY=""                                     # https://build.nvidia.com
HF_TOKEN=""                                           # https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
OLLAMA_BASE_URL="http://localhost:11434/v1"           # Local Ollama (enabled when OLLAMA_ENABLED="true" or toggled in UI)
OLLAMA_ENABLED="false"

# ── Ollama Cloud (PAID — https://ollama.com/api) ─────────────────────
# Per spec: Ollama Cloud is a separate, paid cloud provider. Configured
# independently from local Ollama. Check current plan limits + pricing at
# https://ollama.com before enabling. Usage is tracked for cost control.
OLLAMA_CLOUD_ENABLED="false"                          # Set to "true" to enable Ollama Cloud
OLLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY=""                               # Required when OLLAMA_CLOUD_ENABLED="true"
OLLAMA_CLOUD_BASE_URL="https://ollama.com/api"        # Override only for testing
OLLAMA_CLOUD_TIMEOUT_MS="30000"                       # Request timeout (default 30s)
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MAX_RETRIES="2"                          # Max retries on 429/5xx (default 2)

# Optional: per-agent model selection. If not set, agents use their tier default.
# Discover available models via the admin UI or GET /api/v1/admin/ai-provider/ollama-cloud/models
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_SEO=""
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_CONTENT=""
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_WHATSAPP=""
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_SMS=""
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_LEAD_QUALIFICATION=""
OLLAMA_CLOUD_MODEL_CRM=""

# Optional Free Search & Tool Keys (Wikipedia, Open-Meteo, OpenAlex, Pollinations FLUX require NO key)
TAVILY_API_KEY=""                                     # https://tavily.com (1,000 searches/month free)
BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=""                               # https://brave.com/search/api (2,000 queries/month free)


# ─── ALO Education staff auth + UCI/UMC (grafted subsystem) ─────────
# Session signing secret for staff dashboards (/login,/dashboard,/console,
# /reports,/settings,/admin/uci) — required, min 16 chars:
SESSION_SECRET="replace-with-openssl-rand-hex-32"

# Universal Messaging Channel service (mini-services/messaging-channel):
UMC_SERVICE_URL="http://127.0.0.1:3010"

# Password-reset OTP delivery honesty: with no SMTP configured, set to true
# so the OTP is returned in the HTTP response for that request only.
# Set to false in production and deliver out-of-band.
AUTH_EXPOSE_RESET_OTP="false"
